  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OCHA f&#xe4;ltsamordning 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s support to OCHA for humanitarian field coordination during     2010-2013 (335 MSEK: 75 MSEK for 2010, 80 MSEK for 2011, and twice 90 MSEK for following years). In 2011, Sida&apos;s contribution is            distributed among 21 OCHA offices, the whole RRM amount was mobilised by OCHA for Sudan at the beginning of the year.</narrative>
  </description>
